WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.253
("Silicon Death" by
Warner/Chappell Production Music)

00:00:03.625 --> 00:00:05.931
- You're not going to
give me just a few coins

00:00:05.931 --> 00:00:07.416
after everything I've done for you?

00:00:07.416 --> 00:00:09.626
- What happened to the
coins I already gave you?

00:00:09.626 --> 00:00:12.277
- That ghost hunting business
was a sound investment.

00:00:12.477 --> 00:00:13.662
Mario, where are you going?

00:00:13.662 --> 00:00:15.757
- Ugh, you just sit
there and you sit there

00:00:15.757 --> 00:00:17.176
and never say anything!

00:00:17.176 --> 00:00:19.160
I carry on every conversation!

00:00:20.094 --> 00:00:21.192
Oh my God!

00:00:21.192 --> 00:00:22.597
- Ow, ow, ow, ow, my neck!

00:00:22.597 --> 00:00:23.705
Yoshi, you're going to pay for this!

00:00:23.705 --> 00:00:24.888
- What? How is this my fault?

00:00:24.888 --> 00:00:25.934
- You're throwing bananas!

00:00:25.934 --> 00:00:30.190
(both bickering)

00:00:33.517 --> 00:00:34.818
- [Voiceover] Don't work so hard.

00:00:34.818 --> 00:00:35.944
You're just like your mother.

00:00:35.944 --> 00:00:37.237
- What would you know, dad?

00:00:37.237 --> 00:00:38.113
You're never home.

00:00:38.113 --> 00:00:38.703
- [Voiceover] Where do you think

00:00:38.703 --> 00:00:40.115
that money in your ATM comes from?

00:00:40.115 --> 00:00:41.783
- Those are my battle winnings, dad!

00:00:41.783 --> 00:00:44.724
- Oh sure, I guess you know
everything about everything.

00:00:44.724 --> 00:00:45.954
- I didn't say that!

00:00:45.954 --> 00:00:48.039
I was just saying that Link always wears

00:00:48.039 --> 00:00:49.958
that same stupid outfit everyday.

00:00:49.958 --> 00:00:50.449
- He looks cute.

00:00:50.449 --> 00:00:52.502
- All he does is talk
to that weirdo Tingle.

00:00:52.502 --> 00:00:53.670
- Tingle's a nice elf.
- And is he

00:00:53.670 --> 00:00:56.006
still playing the ocarina?

00:00:56.006 --> 00:00:57.924
- He uses it to solve his puzzles!

00:00:57.924 --> 00:00:59.509
- Are you listening to yourself?

00:00:59.509 --> 00:01:00.719
- [Voiceover] Maybe Space
Pirates wouldn't keep

00:01:00.719 --> 00:01:03.805
taking over Zebes if anyone
besides me carried a Zero Laser.

00:01:03.805 --> 00:01:05.970
- [Voiceover] Wow, that's a
really ignorant thing to say.

00:01:05.970 --> 00:01:08.268
More weapons only lead
to more boss battles.

00:01:08.268 --> 00:01:09.227
- [Voiceover] Maybe in Dreamland,

00:01:09.227 --> 00:01:10.645
but try living in the real world.

00:01:10.645 --> 00:01:13.813
- [Voiceover] At Samus, you
should really read this article.

00:01:14.028 --> 00:01:16.126
- [Voiceover] What happened
on Planet Zebes is a hoax.

00:01:16.126 --> 00:01:17.569
Your government is lying to you.

00:01:17.569 --> 00:01:18.987
- Pika, Pika, Pika!

00:01:18.987 --> 00:01:19.988
(Donkey Kong shouting)

00:01:19.988 --> 00:01:21.167
Pika, Pika, Pika!

00:01:21.167 --> 00:01:22.407
(Donkey Kong shouting)

00:01:22.407 --> 00:01:23.439
Pikachu!

00:01:23.439 --> 00:01:24.367
(Donkey Kong shouting)

00:01:24.367 --> 00:01:25.494
Pika?

00:01:25.494 --> 00:01:27.241
(video game chime)

00:01:28.056 --> 00:01:31.424
("Silicon Death" by
Warner/Chappell Production Music)

00:01:32.307 --> 00:01:36.192
- Please, Mario why can't
you just teach me to type?

00:01:37.023 --> 00:01:38.308
I want to write letters!

00:01:38.308 --> 00:01:39.674
- We gotta race.

00:01:39.674 --> 00:01:40.373
- Mario?

00:01:40.373 --> 00:01:41.834
- We gotta, I gotta race.

